$Notes:
Physical Phase 1 telemetry soak fixture.  This is a deliberately quiet solo
mission: it has one protected player start, no other ships, no events, and no
goals.  It must be loaded as a normal mission by the engine; it is not a
simulation or a test harness replacement.
$End Notes:

